  characterName: Adam Darwish
  promptText: Settlers have begun burning our ancient olive trees. If I film them
    to report it, they will retaliate against my family. Do I stay silent to protect
    my loved ones, or document it to save our history?
  leftAnswer: Yes, film and report it; evidence can force action, though it brings
    danger.
  rightAnswer: No, stay silent for safety; protect your family first and heal later.
